BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (direct public-web, DNS, or MX extraction when appropriate. Interchangeable means compatible rights and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (useful fields, not merely matching JSON keys. Public visibility does not erase privacy, access, contract, or) Tj ET
