BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (minimize personal information. DNS and MX establish domain or mail-routing facts; they do not establish) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (that a named person owns a mailbox or wants outreach. If no authorized substitute exists, return a field-level) Tj ET
