BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (support. Price paid fallback capacity before committing to response-time obligations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (Instrument every enrichment request with cache age, provider attempts, useful fields returned, billable calls,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (latency, and the customer's allowed purpose. Track cost per useful accepted record rather than cost per) Tj ET
