BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Run two workers against the same source event and acceptance event; require one lead, one accepted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (transition, and one invoice.) Tj ET
