BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (2. Assemble the Six-Module Transactional Production Reference) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 610.65 Tm (operating_framework) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 588.42 Tm (The six modules below form one copy-pasteable Python reference program when concatenated in row) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 573.20 Tm (order. Run it against a fresh local SQLite file using Python 3.9 or later and SQLite 3.25 or later. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 557.97 Tm (deliberately handles no outreach credentials, payment initiation, or consumer identity enrichment. Module) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 542.75 Tm (one creates the journal, immutable identifiers, uniqueness constraints, and explicit transaction wrapper.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 527.52 Tm (Module two fingerprints intake payloads; repeating an identical event returns the same lead, while reusing its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 512.30 Tm (key with different evidence raises an error. Module three serializes verification and acceptance under BEGIN) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 497.07 Tm (IMMEDIATE, checks the expected version, and inserts the opportunity invoice inside that same transaction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 481.85 Tm (Concurrent writers therefore cannot accept the same version twice or create duplicate charges through this) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 466.62 Tm (workflow. A stale reviewer must reload the record rather than overwrite another reviewer's decision. Install) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 451.40 Tm (the schema and views before starting workers, and give each worker its own connection with the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 436.17 Tm (connection settings. Keep the database on a supported local filesystem, not a shared network mount. Lock) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 420.95 Tm (contention may delay or reject work; it must never cause a caller to invent a new event identifier.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 405.72 Tm (The verification hold is a contractual billing hold, not custody of client funds. Pending records can become) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 390.50 Tm (verified or rejected; verified records can become accepted or rejected. Accepted records are terminal in this) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 375.27 Tm (reference, and acceptance creates exactly one $3,750 fee. There is no escrow account, borrower settlement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 360.05 Tm (balance, or merchant principal inside operator revenue. Evidence references point to access-controlled) Tj ET
